;
; How Watchfire files one emergency contact in MYRA (watchfire_rules.h
; WF5): its place on the list (the order to ring), the member id call.start
; rings, how many bytes of name the person typed (kept as typed) and when
; it was set (ms since 1970).
^ZXWFCON(seq:i2) = peer:i10! ^ bytes:i2! ^ stamp:i15!
